  <div class="mb-8">
    <div class="mb-5">
      <h3 class="adt-h3 inline-block bg-green-400 px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-left" data-id="pg094_n0005">Situata 1.</h3>
    </div>

    <p class="adt-body leading-relaxed text-left mb-3">
      <span data-id="pg094_n0007">Pas mb&#xeb;rritjes s&#xeb; fundit t&#xeb; turist&#xeb;ve, udh&#xeb;rr&#xeb;fyesi u drejtua p&#xeb;r te grupi japonez dhe filloi bisedimin me ta.</span>
      <span data-id="pg094_n0008">Ai nuk e dinte arsyen p&#xeb;rse ky grup kishte ardhur prej s&#xeb; largu n&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;, prandaj menj&#xeb;her&#xeb; u interesua q&#xeb; ta shuante k&#xeb;t&#xeb; kureshtje.</span>
    </p>

    <p class="adt-body leading-relaxed text-left mb-3">
      <span data-id="pg094_n0010">- P&#xeb;rsh&#xeb;ndetje dhe mir&#xeb; se erdh&#xeb;t n&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;!</span>
      <span data-id="pg094_n0011">Jam i lumtur q&#xeb; keni ardhur n&#xeb; shtetin ton&#xeb;.</span>
    </p>

    <p class="adt-body leading-relaxed text-left mb-3">
      <span data-id="pg094_n0013">- Konnichiwa (p&#xeb;rsh&#xeb;ndetje), faleminderit shum&#xeb; p&#xeb;r mikpritjen!</span>
      <span data-id="pg094_n0014">Shpresoj t&#xeb; kalojm&#xeb; mir&#xeb; s&#xeb; bashku!</span>
    </p>

    <p class="adt-body leading-relaxed text-left mb-3">
      <span data-id="pg094_n0016">- Meq&#xeb; jemi duke biseduar, mund t&#x2019;ju pyes pse zgjodh&#xeb;t pik&#xeb;risht Kosov&#xeb;n p&#xeb;r ta vizituar?</span>
    </p>

    <p class="adt-body leading-relaxed text-left mb-3">
      <span data-id="pg094_n0018">- Ne jemi duke b&#xeb;r&#xeb; disa hulumtime p&#xeb;r pasurit&#xeb; n&#xeb;ntok&#xeb;sore t&#xeb; vendeve t&#xeb; Evrop&#xeb;s dhe, nd&#xeb;r to, zgjodh&#xeb;m edhe Kosov&#xeb;n.</span>
      <span data-id="pg094_n0019">P&#xeb;r pasurit&#xeb; n&#xeb;ntok&#xeb;sore t&#xeb; vendit tuaj nuk kishte shum&#xeb; informacione n&#xeb; internet, prandaj ato q&#xeb; do t&#x2019;i m&#xeb;sojm&#xeb; gjat&#xeb; koh&#xeb;s sa jemi k&#xeb;tu do t&#x2019;i shfaqim n&#xeb; uebfaqe.</span>
    </p>

    <p class="adt-body leading-relaxed text-left mb-3">
      <span data-id="pg094_n0021">- Para se t&#x2019;i vizitojm&#xeb; vendet q&#xeb; ju nevojiten p&#xeb;r hulumtim, mund t&#x2019;ju tregoj n&#xeb; pika t&#xeb; shkurtra p&#xeb;r pasurit&#xeb; tona n&#xeb;ntok&#xeb;sore.</span>
      <span data-id="pg094_n0022">Kosova ka nj&#xeb; n&#xeb;ntok&#xeb; mjaft t&#xeb; pasur, duke filluar nga th&#xeb;ngjilli linjit - me sasi m&#xeb; t&#xeb; madhe, i cili shfryt&#xeb;zohet p&#xeb;r prodhimin e energjis&#xeb; elektrike n&#xeb; Termocentralin &#x201c;Kosova A&#x201d; dhe &#x201c;Kosova B&#x201d;, minerale t&#xeb; plumbit, t&#xeb; zinkut, t&#xeb; argjendit, t&#xeb; arit e shum&#xeb; t&#xeb; tjera.</span>
      <span data-id="pg094_n0023">Miniera m&#xeb; aktive &#xeb;sht&#xeb; &#x201c;Trep&#xe7;a&#x201d;, e cila ndodhet n&#xeb; Mitrovic&#xeb;.</span>
    </p>

    <p class="adt-body leading-relaxed text-left mb-8">
      <span data-id="pg094_n0025">- Sipas atyre q&#xeb; that&#xeb; ju, Kosova qenka mjaft e pasur me minerale.</span>
    </p>
